mechanism: taste -> MN9 in MaleCNS is disinhibitory; a silent network cannot express that, and no uniform manipulation restores it with specificity. Reproducing feeding needs cell-specific spontaneous activity, i.e. the state-dependent modulation this model omits (cf. Shiu et al. 2024, which reported the same limitation for inhibitory neurons at 0 Hz baseline).

